WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.836 --> 00:00:14.116
I wonder if the sun debates dawn

00:00:14.116 --> 00:00:15.676
some mornings

00:00:15.676 --> 00:00:17.236
not wanting to rise

00:00:17.236 --> 00:00:18.796
out of bed

00:00:18.796 --> 00:00:22.116
from under that down-feather horizon

00:00:22.436 --> 00:00:25.036
if the sky grows tired

00:00:25.036 --> 00:00:27.636
of being everywhere at once

00:00:27.636 --> 00:00:29.196
adapting to the mood

00:00:29.196 --> 00:00:31.156
swings of the weather

00:00:31.596 --> 00:00:33.836
if clouds drift off

00:00:33.836 --> 00:00:37.276
trying to hold themselves together

00:00:37.276 --> 00:00:39.636
make deals with gravity

00:00:39.636 --> 00:00:42.556
to loiter a little longer

00:00:42.836 --> 00:00:46.676
I wonder if rain is scared

00:00:46.676 --> 00:00:48.036
of falling

00:00:48.116 --> 00:00:49.196
if she has trouble

00:00:49.196 --> 00:00:50.356
letting go

00:00:50.676 --> 00:00:52.436
if snowflakes get sick

00:00:52.436 --> 00:00:55.916
of being perfect all the time

00:00:56.156 --> 00:00:57.156
each one

00:00:57.156 --> 00:00:59.396
trying to be one-of-a-kind

00:00:59.756 --> 00:01:02.636
I wonder if stars wish

00:01:02.636 --> 00:01:06.036
upon themselves before they die

00:01:06.356 --> 00:01:08.236
if they need to teach their young

00:01:08.236 --> 00:01:10.076
how to shine

00:01:10.596 --> 00:01:13.916
I wonder if shadows long

00:01:13.916 --> 00:01:17.316
to just-for-once feel the sun

00:01:17.676 --> 00:01:19.556
if they get lost in the shuffle

00:01:19.556 --> 00:01:21.436
not knowing where they’re from

00:01:21.756 --> 00:01:24.596
I wonder if sunrise

00:01:24.596 --> 00:01:26.356
and sunset

00:01:26.356 --> 00:01:27.956
respect each other

00:01:28.156 --> 00:01:30.116
even though they’ve never met

00:01:30.476 --> 00:01:32.276
if storms have regrets

00:01:32.396 --> 00:01:34.836
if volcanoes get stressed

00:01:34.876 --> 00:01:39.316
if compost believes in life

00:01:39.316 --> 00:01:40.876
after death

00:01:41.316 --> 00:01:47.156
I wonder if breath ever thinks of suicide

00:01:47.556 --> 00:01:50.956
if the wind just wants to sit

00:01:50.956 --> 00:01:53.116
still sometimes

00:01:53.236 --> 00:01:55.716
and watch the world pass him by

00:01:55.876 --> 00:01:57.636
if smoke was born

00:01:57.636 --> 00:01:59.956
knowing how to rise

00:02:00.116 --> 00:02:04.076
if rainbows get shy backstage

00:02:04.316 --> 00:02:08.076
not sure if their colors match right

00:02:08.796 --> 00:02:12.116
I wonder if lightning needs an alarm clock

00:02:12.116 --> 00:02:13.676
to know when to crack

00:02:13.676 --> 00:02:15.916
if rivers ever stop

00:02:15.916 --> 00:02:17.876
and think of turning back

00:02:18.156 --> 00:02:20.716
if streams meet the wrong sea

00:02:20.716 --> 00:02:23.156
and their whole lives run off-track

00:02:23.756 --> 00:02:26.796
I wonder if the snow

00:02:26.796 --> 00:02:28.556
wants to be black

00:02:28.996 --> 00:02:31.676
if the soil thinks she’s too dark

00:02:31.756 --> 00:02:35.236
if butterflies want
to cover up their marks

00:02:35.236 --> 00:02:38.476
if rocks are self-conscious
of their weight

00:02:38.756 --> 00:02:42.636
if mountains are insecure
of their strength

00:02:43.156 --> 00:02:47.436
I wonder if waves get discouraged

00:02:47.436 --> 00:02:50.156
crawling up the sand

00:02:50.156 --> 00:02:52.516
only to be pulled back again

00:02:52.516 --> 00:02:54.436
to where they began

00:02:54.636 --> 00:02:57.556
if land feels stepped upon

00:02:58.076 --> 00:03:01.196
if sand feels insignificant

00:03:01.556 --> 00:03:04.676
if trees need to question their lovers

00:03:04.676 --> 00:03:06.716
to know where they stand

00:03:07.076 --> 00:03:10.436
if branches waver at the crossroads

00:03:10.436 --> 00:03:14.676
unsure of which way to grow

00:03:15.036 --> 00:03:20.356
if leaves understand they’re replaceable

00:03:20.756 --> 00:03:25.116
and they still dance when the wind blows

00:03:25.756 --> 00:03:27.396
I wonder

00:03:27.636 --> 00:03:29.556
where the moon goes

00:03:29.716 --> 00:03:31.516
when she is in hiding

00:03:31.956 --> 00:03:34.436
I want to find her there

00:03:34.716 --> 00:03:36.196
and watch the ocean

00:03:36.196 --> 00:03:38.796
spin from a distance

00:03:39.156 --> 00:03:40.756
listen to her

00:03:40.756 --> 00:03:43.436
stir in her sleep

00:03:44.356 --> 00:03:49.276
effort give way to existence

00:03:49.756 --> 00:03:50.756
(Music)

